WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:21.271
Today is a special day for our family.

2
00:00:21.272 --> 00:00:26.754
It is Grandma's birthday.

3
00:00:26.755 --> 00:00:31.699
We are going to have a birthday party!

4
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:33.502
Don't tell Grandma!

5
00:00:33.503 --> 00:00:37.355
The party is a surprise!

6
00:00:37.356 --> 00:00:42.629
Everybody has a job to do.

7
00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:48.531
My sister keeps Grandma busy outside.

8
00:00:48.532 --> 00:00:51.223
Mom bakes a birthday cake.

9
00:00:51.224 --> 00:00:54.827
Dad decorates the room.

10
00:00:54.828 --> 00:00:58.537
I set the table.

11
00:00:58.538 --> 00:01:02.595
My younger brother peeks out the window.

12
00:01:02.596 --> 00:01:06.516
He watches for Grandma.

13
00:01:06.517 --> 00:01:08.468
"Are we ready now?

14
00:01:08.469 --> 00:01:14.822
We have the cake, the birthday card, the gifts, and the candles."

15
00:01:14.823 --> 00:01:18.019
"Yes, we are ready."

16
00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:27.389
"Now whistle to your sister."

17
00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:30.465
Then she brings Grandma inside.

18
00:01:30.466 --> 00:01:36.193
Now here comes Grandma! "Surprise!"

19
00:01:36.194 --> 00:01:40.085
"Oh my!"

20
00:01:40.086 --> 00:01:43.918
"Grandma, blow out the candles!"

21
00:01:43.919 --> 00:01:46.627
"Make a wish too!"

22
00:01:46.628 --> 00:01:51.932
"Okay, my dears!"

23
00:01:51.933 --> 00:01:56.581
We all sing "Happy Birthday" to Grandma.

24
00:01:56.582 --> 00:02:02.357
Grandma has a big, big smile!
